re  brooke is captured by four elbowed  freaks and  robin somewhat auspiciously finds  herself in the company of those that  want to bring her to dragon  as a friend at this point we still have  no idea  as to what luffy has done and as the  story continues we get a host of short  scenes  duvall has been keeping the thousand  sunny safe princess vivi her father and  crocodile all react to what luffy has  been doing in the newspaper  both garp and sengoku retire making room  for the next generation oukiji and  spoker both react also to what luffy has  done but perhaps the most  interesting we get a small look at kobe  who demonstrated haki power  in this short but illuminating scene we  get information that apparently every  naval personnel from vice admiral and up  all have some form of hacky ability but  once that scene comes to a close  we finally learn what luffy in fact did  to grab the attention  of the world it could have been  advantageous to remain hidden go into  hiding and to pretend to be dead like  the navy already expected him to be  but instead luffy rocks up to navy  headquarters where the war has just  finished taking  place as it's under construction all the  naval personnel are away by the way  because this is the last place they  would expect anyone to be after what's  just happened and in this stroke of  genius he commandeers a ship  sails around the island in a circle  before ringing the bell on the island  16 times apparently the bell he rang is  called the ox bell and to ring it 16  times is to signify thanks for the prior  year  and prayers for the upcoming one it's  only carried out by the navy and for  luffy to be pictured doing it in a  moment of silence it's a gesture to the  rest of the new world  that the new era has begun but what  makes this interesting is when each of  the straw hats see this article  on the paper they all come to the same  conclusion putting a hall to their plans  that they had to regroup  instead focusing all their