d loving  stories they are the only place where  magic  actually exists where good triumphs over  evil and where we can all escape  to whenever our daily lives become  overwhelming you can take a small child  full of dreams and through his eyes take  us on an adventure the likes of which  can uplift us  and fill us with satisfaction and so  despite my eyes full of tears despite my  excitement and sense of loss here  i couldn't help but smile as i watched  otis so the very last stitch  in the masterpiece of a tapestry he's  woven over the course of what was then  13 years of work this is an incredible  and special moment in what i've come to  understand as an incredibly special  story  at the end of my second video covering  this series i confess that one piece  could very well be something i can  appreciate but never fully love as much  as those that grew up with it  and while i can't compare my enjoyment  to anyone else's  this series has on a fundamental level  changed how i view storytelling and has  seriously helped me through some really  tough patches over the last three months  i'll be taking my short break now so in  case youtube forgets about me  if you all do want to see more from me  maybe subscribe and hit that  notification bell in case youtube  doesn't show my videos in the future  when i return  but this most definitely isn't a goodbye  it's a see you later  so until we meet again guys i've been  totally not mark  i'll see you when i see you and thank  you so much for taking the time out of  your days to share it with me  [Music]  you
 

